>I have a lawful unicorn corpse and there is a lawful altar nearby.  I am
>neutral exactly how do I convert the lawful altar to neutral?  I read the
>spoiler I think ver 700 but it assumed I knew how.

To convert an altar to your own alignment, you need to offer corpses on
the offending altar. Any corpse will do for this purpose. The
conversion may fail. The higher your level, the higher the chance that
you will succeed. You will fail if a randomly generated number between
1 and (your level + 8) is <= 5. Thus, the chance of you succeeding is
(2+level)/(4+level).

